# CONTAIN harness (hard stop)

This repo is CONTAIN. App Builder QA in `AGENTS.md` is void here.

Drive the live bay only with:

```
node scripts/hangar.mjs start   # vite + owned paint page; not your Chrome
node scripts/bay.mjs health
node scripts/bay.mjs restage <sceneId>
node scripts/bay.mjs wait <frames>
node scripts/bay.mjs peek
node scripts/bay.mjs shot screenshots/<name>.jpg
node scripts/bay.mjs history
node scripts/bay.mjs effects
```

`hangar.mjs` holds one Playwright page (`window.__bayOwned`) on :8080. That is the sim. Agents never launch Chrome, never Playwright, never click RUN/RESET. Named miss: `omp-browser-harness`.

`health` must show `takers >= 1` and `paints >= 1`. `paints: 0` is blocked (the headless hangar-taker is a second Rapier world — do not treat it as the canvas). Do not open a tab to recover.

Proof is peek/history JSON **and** the shot JPEG from that same world. Peek xyz is not a picture. Tune scenes by restaging through `bay.mjs`.
